  "summary_md": "**Peter Ting ([@peterting310](https://x.com/peterting310/status/2116188177488830828))** explains Microsoft's open-sourced **MXC** cross-platform sandbox SDK: JSON policies for readable/writable paths and egress enforced by OS isolation (Bubblewrap, Seatbelt, up to full VMs), with Node, Rust and .NET SDKs; he sketches wiring run() into an agent's tool loop and notes Codex can prefer MXC on Windows ([microsoft/mxc](https://github.com/microsoft/mxc)).",
